# Base URL of the calculator backend, without a trailing slash.
#
# Leave empty (the default) to call the API on the same origin as the
# frontend. In development the Vite dev server proxies /api to the backend,
# so no value is needed.
#
# Set it only when the backend is served from a different origin, which also
# requires the backend to allow cross-origin requests (CORS).
#
# Copy this file to .env.local to override it locally.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=

# Not read by the app: where the Vite dev/preview server proxies /api to.
# Set it in the shell, e.g. API_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:9000 npm run dev
# Default: http://localhost:8080
